methodology used to measure and evaluate environmental impacts throughout a complete life cycle. Studies are commonly used for ESG reporting, sustainability disclosures, green product development, carbon reduction initiatives, and environmental compliance programs.</p><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Raw material extraction</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Energy consumption</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Water usage</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Carbon emissions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Waste generation</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Transportation impacts</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Manufacturing impacts</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>End-of-life disposal or recycling</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="w-full min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-24 self-start"><figure class="w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784002997/lca_n1o83e.png" class="w-full h-auto block" alt="Life cycle assessment visualization with sustainability icons and environmental data analysis" width="1440" height="810" decoding="async"/></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">LCA <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">Independent verification of Life Cycle Assessment studies and environmental impact calculations. Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert S.A., Athens, Greece â€” a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-boxes-stacked text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Product Life Cycle Assessments</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Independent verification of product-level LCA studies across the full value chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-building text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Corporate Sustainability Reporting</h4